Package: com.albrhi.ytmusic
Name: Albrhi for YouTube Music
Version: 0.9.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Synced lyrics, no ads, background playback, the hidden speed control, seek buttons, no autoplay radio, casting, an OLED theme and SponsorBlock. WITHOUT PREMIUM: no paid subscription is unlocked and you are never reported as a subscriber. Lyrics are fetched from outside services (LRCLib, Genius, MusixMatch, NetEase, the video description) -- that is what a lyrics feature is, and it is on because it was asked for. Translating them is a separate switch, off, and needs a key you supply. Hooks carried over from YTMusicUltimate by dayanch96 and YTMEnhanced by py233, both GPLv3; their Premium claim is deliberately not included.
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
Conflicts: com.albrhi.ytmusic.roothide, com.dvntm.ytmultimate
Replaces: com.albrhi.ytmusic.roothide
Author: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn <ibrahimalrahan01@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn <ibrahimalrahan01@gmail.com>
Tag: role::hacker
